{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111431","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111431/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111431/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111431/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111431","id":3496838848,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6sxpTR","number":111431,"title":"Reorder registration of types, to register supertypes before subtypes.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-10-08T20:44:14Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T17:00:22Z","closed_at":"2025-10-09T16:52:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111431","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111431.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111431.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-09T16:52:59Z"},"body":"- Prepares for and motivated by #106873 \r\n\r\nThis PR addresses various inconsistencies around registration order, where subtypes are registered before their respective supertypes.\r\n\r\nMy strategy:\r\n- \"Fundamental\" types (like `Texture`) that are referenced in many of the blocks are registered at the top.\r\n- Other supertypes are placed above the respective subtypes, if it fits the respective block. Most move only a few lines.\r\n- The exception is `CanvasItem` which is moved from the 2D nodes to the Control nodes (since they're registered above 2D, and also inherit from `CanvasItem`).\r\n- The optional \"XR\" block is not depended on and moves to the bottom of the `#ifdef`.\r\n\r\nI think that covers everything. I worked entirely with cut-paste; no registrations were modified, added or removed.\r\n\r\n## About the docs change\r\n\r\nThe docs instantiate classes automatically to infer default values of properties. Abstract classes cannot be instantiated. To infer default values in abstract classes, the docs will try to instantiate a subclass.\r\nThis PR triggered a re-order, which made `CanvasItem`'s 'designated subclass' be `Control` instead of `Node2D`. This caused `physics_interpolation_mode` to be changed, since `Node2D` has a different default from `Control` and `CanvasItem`.\r\n\r\nI fixed the problem by supplying a default directly in `CanvasItem` explicitly. This required adding an explicit path for 'non-instantiatable objects that supply their own defaults', which was previously not supported.\r\n\r\nAnother solution would have been to check the superclass has the same property, and use the same default. However, this may not catch if the subtype changes the default. But, this could be added in a future PR. Even so, to respect `ADD_PROPERTY_DEFAULT` would be a prerequisite, because otherwise incorrect values may appear. So I think adding support for `ADD_PROPERTY_DEFAULT` in abstract classes is the best way to fix this, for now.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111431/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111431/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}